00014954                            ; Subroutine to make Sonic perform a peelout
00014954                            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
00014954                            ; If you use this makes sure to search for ;Peelout in Sonic1.asm
00014954                            ; ||||||||||||||| S U B	R O U T	I N E |||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||
